WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.150
A new generation is taking over the farm.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.050
With hotter summers, new pests,
and tired soil.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.850
FarmPartner is their advisor.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.100
Right in the chat.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.100
Drop a pin.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.850
Our AI reads 20 years of NASA data
for that field,

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.500
and compares your crop rotation
with better options.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.900
With the evidence, and the risks.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.350
No forms.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.300
Type, or just talk,
in 46 languages.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.300
FarmPartner.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.850
Your field, read from space.
